# Language Policy

## Code and comments

Write all engine source code, inline comments, scripts, tests, agent skills, Cursor rules, plans, and repository documentation in **English**.

## Vault note content (fiches)

Mounted vault pages (`src/content/docs/**/*.md`, `src/content/docs/**/*.mdx`, or the external vault path) may use **any language** configured in the vault and implied by note location — for example French at the vault root and English under `en/`, as defined in `site.config.json` locales and folder layout.

Do not translate or anglicize vault note content unless the user explicitly asks. Match the language of the target note path and locale.
